OL,3,GNEWSAI interviewed Christa Pike 20
OL,4,Ayears ago - I can't stop thinking about
OL,5,Aher
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo decades ago, Helen Roberts met
OL,8,FTennessee death row inmate Christa Pike
OL,9,Fto understand the woman behind the
OL,10,Fbrutal murder of Colleen Slemmer.
OL,12,FAged 30, Pike had served 11 years on
OL,13,Fdeath row and was the youngest woman to
OL,14,Freceive the penalty in the United
OL,15,FStates when Roberts interviewed her as
OL,16,Freal life editor of women's lifestyle
OL,17,Fmagazine.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
