OL,3,GNEWSAI interviewed Christa Pike 20
OL,4,Ayears ago - I can't stop thinking about
OL,5,Aher
OL,6,
OL,7,FPike, now aged 50, faced her
OL,8,Flong-awaited execution on Wednesday,
OL,9,Fbut survived two lethal doses of
OL,10,Fpentobarbital and remains in critical
OL,11,Fcondition.
OL,13,FRoberts, who has been following the
OL,14,Fdevelopments, reflected on her
OL,15,Fconflicting encounter with Pike and how
OL,16,Fit had stayed with her as both a
OL,17,Fjournalist and a human being.
